1
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,040
Don't be afraid.

2
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,240
I'm here.

3
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:32,200
Are you okay?

4
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:35,520
I thought I would never see you again.

5
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:39,920
Relax.

6
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:41,400
I'm here.

7
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,320
I will never let anything happen to you.

8
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,000
I'm... I'm sorry.

9
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,120
Qi Miao.

10
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,520
There's something I want to tell you.

11
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,240
I finally understand my feelings.

12
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:57,520
I like you.

13
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:58,880
I want to be with you.

14
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,320
Forever.

15
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,640
It's not because of the connection.

16
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,880
It's because, for the first time,

17
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,400
I've felt something different for someone.

18
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,800
And that feeling—

19
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:09,920
it's love.

20
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,680
What's wrong?

21
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,040
What's wrong?

22
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,280
I'm fine.

23
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:24,200
Just overused my energy, that's all.

24
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,480
Are you crazy?

25
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:27,880
Because of that kiss with you earlier,

26
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,240
my crystal recharged its energy.

27
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,600
She's so beautiful.

28
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,720
And—

29
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,640
she's so gentle.

30
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,200
Whose bratty kid is this?

31
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,520
Go play somewhere else.

32
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,360
Let's go.

33
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,520
Even when she's working seriously,

34
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,080
she's stunning.

35
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,880
So they were chatting all along.

36
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,600
Oh my gosh.

37
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:09,880
What's going on?

38
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,760
Ai Yite.

39
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,120
I'm so happy right now!

40
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,000
My dear son has finally found someone!

41
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:19,200
Qi Miao and Hao Ruichi are together now!

42
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,680
See? I told you.

43
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,720
When you like someone,

44
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,120
you need to bravely confess your feelings.

45
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:23,960
Anyway, I'm off.

46
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:26,440
I need to make them a love-filled dinner.

47
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,720
She actually hugged me!

48
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,960
Could it be that she likes me too?

49
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:34,040
Even someone as dense as Hao Ruichi

50
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,080
managed to confess successfully.

51
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,640
I can definitely do it too!

52
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,120
Come over and help me!

53
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:50,320
Piece of cake.

54
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,240
I have something to tell you.

55
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,160
What is it? Spill it.

56
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,760
I...

57
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,080
Actually...

58
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,880
Oh come on, stop being so hesitant.

59
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,960
Just say it if you have something to say.

60
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,600
I want to say...

61
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,200
Are you going to say it or not?

62
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,240
From the moment I first met you,

63
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,520
I deeply fell in love with you.

64
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,680
Will you be my girlfriend?

65
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,160
No, no!

66
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,880
Aren’t we just like brothers?

67
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,559
I’ve never thought about this at all.

68
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:35,960
Aiyet,

69
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:38,560
Drink up!

70
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,480
Don’t drink too much.

71
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,760
If you overdo it,

72
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,200
it might make you lose your memory.

73
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,200
Stop nagging!

74
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,240
Drink!

75
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,400
Hao Ruichi,

76
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:59,320
aren’t we Blue Star people supposed to be really lucky?

77
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:01,320
Why am I so unlucky?

78
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,040
From being chased off Blue Star by you,

79
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,280
to barely escaping here,

80
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,320
and almost losing my life.

81
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,640
All these years,

82
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:14,640
this is the first time I’ve liked a girl.

83
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,560
And she just wants to be my brother?

84
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:19,560
Who wants to just be her brother?

85
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,040
I like her so much!

86
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,200
Why doesn’t she like me back?

87
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,840
Why, Hao Ruichi?

88
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,800
If she doesn’t like me,

89
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,200
then what’s the point of me staying here?

90
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:36,560
What meaning does it have?

91
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,440
Hao Ruichi,

92
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,640
take me away from here.

93
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,320
Hao Ruichi

94
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,280
Take me with you

95
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,840
Bring me along

96
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,640
I’m not leaving anymore

97
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,480
Hao Ruichi

98
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,360
What… what did you say?

99
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,960
I said I want to stay here

100
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,280
I’m not leaving

101
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,040
So

102
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:03,320
Eytet is also someone from your place?

103
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,320
He’s the one I’ve been looking for

104
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,440
No wonder you two know each other

105
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:12,680
Then

106
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:16,080
When you find him, are you going to take him back?

107
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,040
That was the plan

108
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,120
But

109
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,320
Now I’ve fallen for someone

110
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,640
Because of her

111
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,160
I don’t want to leave anymore

112
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:29,440
Qi Miao

113
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,400
I’m staying

114
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,480
That’s wonderful, Hao Ruichi

115
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:39,960
Wait a second

116
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,760
What’s this?

117
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,120
I found this online

118
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,360
A list of little things to do when you’re in love

119
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,520
A hundred wishes I want to fulfill with you

120
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,680
Our first hug

121
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,560
Our first

122
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:06,160
Why are there two question marks here?

123
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,640
That’s something not convenient to write down

124
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,120
Why?

125
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,400
Because

126
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,600
Last time

127
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,840
You got upset over this

128
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,040
It’s a kiss, silly

129
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,360
Dummy

130
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:26,560
But it’s different now

131
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,240
Come here

132
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:37,960
Hey!

133
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:40,880
Alright, alright

134
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:41,680
Bye-bye

135
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,800
Let’s go camping tomorrow

136
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:45,840
Sure

137
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:46,760
So,

138
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,920
is this considered our first date?

139
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:50,000
Of course.

140
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,040
Qi Miao,

141
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,920
are you ready?

142
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:07,680
I’m ready.

143
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,080
What’s wrong?

144
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,520
Do I look bad?

145
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,040
You look amazing.

146
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,240
Miss Qi,

147
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:45,480
may I kiss you?

148
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:54,400
Sis, are you guys ready yet?

149
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:56,680
Sorry.

150
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,080
You two carry on.

151
00:08:58,400 --> 00:08:59,400
I'll wait for you outside.

152
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:05,160
Wasn't this supposed to be just a date between the two of us?

153
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,280
He was free today,

154
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,480
so I invited him along.

155
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:09,680
Let’s go.

156
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:25,400
Report, Goddess!

157
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:27,480
We’ve detected Hao Ruichi’s energy traces.

158
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,720
Find him as soon as possible!

159
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,480
Understood!

160
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,960
Hao Ruichi,

161
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,840
don’t die too soon.

162
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,600
If you're going to die,

163
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:42,320
it has to be at my hands.
